Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(wasm): rebuild euclid wasm with Vietnamese connector
 configs

Built from the HiTechPay hyperswitch branch (crates/euclid_wasm, features
dummy_connector,v1) so the dashboard can configure MoMo, VNPAY, ZaloPay,
Viettel Money, payOS, SePay and Pay2S.

